</div><p><i>"THAT STUFF WiLL iNFECT YOU IF YOU WALK iNSiDE iT"</i>
</p><p><small>- The Note at the start of the Expanded Poolrooms</small>
</p><p><br>
</p><p><b>Level 37.2</b>, also known as <b>The Dark Poolrooms</b>, is a Sublevel in <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Escape_the_Backrooms" title="Escape the Backrooms">Escape the Backrooms</a>. It appears to be a darker and more dangerous version of <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Level_37" title="Level 37">Level 37</a>. The Level is connected to a larger version to <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Level_37" title="Level 37">Level 37</a> called the Expanded Poolrooms.
</p>
