</section><h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Expanded_Poolrooms_2">Expanded Poolrooms</span></h3>
<p>Only one Entity can be found here, but it doesn't appear all that much. This Entity is:
</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Hydrolitis_Plague" title="Hydrolitis Plague">Hydrolitis Plague</a></li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Dark_Poolrooms_2">Dark Poolrooms</span></h3>
<p>Only 2 Entities live within Level 37.2. These Entities are:
</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Clump" title="Clump">Clump</a></li>
<li><a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Hydrolitis_Plague" title="Hydrolitis Plague">Hydrolitis Plague</a></li></ul>
<h2 id="Entrances_&amp;_Exits" class="open-section" section="16" aria-controls="Entrances_&amp;_Exits-collapsible-section" aria-pressed="false" aria-expanded="true" role="button"><div class="section-header-label">Entrances &amp; Exits</div><a href="https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fescapethebackrooms.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLevel_37.2%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D5%26uselang%3Den&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section" class="section-edit-link" aria-label="à¹à¸à¹‰à¹„à¸‚" data-tracking-label="log-in-edit-section" data-auth-modal="signin"><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#wds-icons-pencil-small"></use></svg></a><div class="vertical-separator"></div><button class="chevron-wrapper" aria-controls="Entrances_&amp;_Exits-collapsible-section" aria-label="à¸¢à¸¸à¸š" aria-pressed="false" aria-expanded="true"><svg class="wds-icon wds-icon-small chevron"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#wds-icons-menu-control-small"></use></svg></button></h2><section id="Entrances_&amp;_Exits-collapsible-section" class="mobile-hidden">
</section><h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Entrances">Entrances</span></h3>
<ul><li>Put all 3 of the <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/TV" title="TV">TV's</a> in their respective windows in <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Level_188" title="Level 188">Level 188</a> in order to access the exit door. Then, jump in the pit in the room to get here.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Exits">Exits</span></h3>
<ul><li>Travel in the <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Floatie_Boat" class="mw-redirect" title="Floatie Boat">Floatie Boat</a> until you arrive at the big room, then go up the staircase and slide down any one of the slides to get to <a href="https://escapethebackrooms.fandom.com/wiki/Level_Fun%2B" title="Level Fun+">Level Fun+</a>.</li></ul>
